//// set: cx-c8 — 模型结构（子实例、修饰、继承、记录数组、包记录、外层常量）与 Integer / Boolean / String / 各元素相等的常量数组
//// model: C80
model C80
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  model A constant Real c[3] = {1, 2, 3}; Integer j = 1; Real y = c[j]; end A; A a;
end C80;
//// model: C81
model C81
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  model A constant Real c[3] = {1, 2, 3}; Integer j = 1; Real y = c[j]; end A; A a[2];
end C81;
//// model: C82
model C82
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  model A constant Real c[3] = {1, 2, 3}; Integer j = 1; Real y = c[j]; end A; A a(c = {4, 5, 6});
end C82;
//// model: C83
model C83
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  model A constant Real c[3] = {1, 2, 3}; Integer j = 1; Real y = c[j]; end A; A a[2](c = {{4, 5, 6}, {7, 8, 9}});
end C83;
//// model: C84
model C84
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  model A constant Real c[3] = {1, 2, 3}; Integer j = 1; Real y[2] = c[2:3]; end A; A a[2](c = {{4, 5, 6}, {7, 8, 9}});
end C84;
//// model: C85
model C85
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  model A constant Real c[3] = {1, 2, 3}; end A; model B extends A; Integer j = 1; Real y = c[j]; end B; B b;
end C85;
//// model: C86
model C86
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  model A constant Real c[3] = {1, 2, 3}; end A; model B extends A(c = {4, 5, 6}); Integer j = 1; Real y = c[j]; Real z[2] = c[1:2]; end B; B b;
end C86;
//// model: C87
model C87
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  model A constant Real c[3] = {1, 2, 3}; end A; A a; Real y = a.c[n] + a.c[1];
end C87;
//// model: C88
model C88
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  model A constant Real c[3] = {1, 2, 3}; end A; A a[2]; Real y = sum(a[i].c[2] for i in 1:2);
end C88;
//// model: C89
model C89
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  model A constant Real c[2, 2] = {{1, 2}, {3, 4}}; end A; A a; Real y[2] = a.c[:, n];
end C89;
